    "detailed_description": "<strong>This precision platformer will put your skills and patience to the test. </strong><br>Pounce Cat may seem cute on the surface, but ahead lies a challenge, are you good enough to take it on?<br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>-You are your own worst enemy!<br>Take your time and think about your actions. A small mistake could cost you.<br><br>-Had enough for one day? Your progress is saved on quitting.<br><br><strong>Movement:</strong><br>-Charge your jump to pounce higher, but be careful not to fall. (Comes with cat bum wiggle animation while charging)<br><br>-Once you're in the air there's no turning back. You'll either land safely or with a thud. There is no in-between.<br><br><strong>Atmosphere:</strong><br>A fantasy style, pixel world complete with a rather cute cat.<br><br>Do you have the skills and patience to make it to the top?",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>This precision platformer will put your skills and patience to the test. </strong><br>Pounce Cat may seem cute on the surface, but ahead lies a challenge, are you good enough to take it on?<br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>-You are your own worst enemy!<br>Take your time and think about your actions. A small mistake could cost you.<br><br>-Had enough for one day? Your progress is saved on quitting.<br><br><strong>Movement:</strong><br>-Charge your jump to pounce higher, but be careful not to fall. (Comes with cat bum wiggle animation while charging)<br><br>-Once you're in the air there's no turning back. You'll either land safely or with a thud. There is no in-between.<br><br><strong>Atmosphere:</strong><br>A fantasy style, pixel world complete with a rather cute cat.<br><br>Do you have the skills and patience to make it to the top?",
    "short_description": "Pounce your way to the top in this high-stakes precision platformer. Try to keep your cool and claw your way up, but be careful, a single fall could spell disaster. And remember, if you do fall... stay PAWsitive!",
